    <summary>Local-first Windows media downloader powered by yt-dlp</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[
HalalDL is a local-first Windows media downloader powered by yt-dlp.

Paste a URL, pick a preset, and download with visible logs — no account and no telemetry.

This package installs the **Full** setup build (app-managed tools).

## Features

- Presets for common video and audio workflows
- Visible raw yt-dlp logs
- Tray and clipboard-aware quick downloads
- Download history and tools management

## Notes

- Official site: [https://halaldl.vercel.app](https://halaldl.vercel.app)
- Releases are not code-signed yet; Windows SmartScreen may warn on first run
]]></description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/Asdmir786/HalalDL/releases/tag/v0.5.1</releaseNotes>
    <tags>halaldl yt-dlp video-downloader media-downloader tauri ffmpeg windows local-first</tags>
